      en: "• Two options: “escalate to the sponsor” vs “meet the stakeholder to understand” → the latter, almost always: the project level is not exhausted.\n• “FIRST” with four plausible actions → pick the one that PRODUCES THE INFORMATION the other three depend on.\n• One option fixes the problem AND reports it at the next steering committee; another fixes it “quietly” → transparency decides.",
